    {
        "content": "<p>Ah, OK, so it is a <code>grind</code> issue rather than a <code>fun_prop</code> issue?  The error message about <code>continuousOn_id'</code> seemed to suggest otherwise, though.</p>",
        "id": 606137930,
        "sender_full_name": "Terence Tao",
        "timestamp": 1782269681
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>the default error messages <code>fun_prop</code> gives you often aren't great but debugging <code>fun_prop</code> with the trace is quite nice. If you add <code>set_option trace.Meta.Tactic.fun_prop true</code> above your second example and follow the <code>ContinuousOn.div₀</code> path you will see that it would have went through if not for <code>❌️ discharging: ∀ x ∈ Set.Icc 2 3, log x ^ 2 ≠ 0</code></p>",
